] [17592186355861 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535575 true] [17592186355861 1100 "Calculate the flux of the vector field\n\n$$\nF(x,y,z)=⟨{cos}^{2}⁡(xy),\\,{cos}^{2}⁡(xy),\\,1⟩,\n$$\n\nwhere the surface $S$ is defined by $z=\\operatorname{tan}⁡(xy)$ for $0\\le x\\le 1$ and $-x\\le y\\le 0.$" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355861 1113 #uuid "82c8b088-1d00-54ec-a79c-4ebe46ed74fd" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355861 1145 "For a surface $S$ given by $z=g(x,y)$ for $(x,y)\\in D,$ the flux of a vector field $F(x,y,z)=⟨P,\\,Q,\\,R⟩$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{D}(-P\\frac{∂g}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{∂y}+R)\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the partial derivatives of the graph $z=g(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂g}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{tan}⁡(xy))=\\frac{y}{{cos}^{2}⁡(xy)} \\\\ \\frac{∂g}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{tan}⁡(xy))=\\frac{x}{{cos}^{2}⁡(xy)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the flux of $F$ through $S$ is given by \n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}⟨{cos}^{2}⁡(xy),\\,{cos}^{2}⁡(xy),\\,1⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the equation $z=g(x,y)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(x,y,g(x,y)) & =⟨{cos}^{2}⁡(xy),\\,{cos}^{2}⁡(xy),\\,1⟩{|}_{z=\\operatorname{tan}⁡(xy)} \\\\  & =⟨{{{cos}^{2}⁡(xy)}_{⏟}}_{P},\\,{{{cos}^{2}⁡(xy)}_{⏟}}_{Q},\\,{{1}_{⏟}}_{R}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can evaluate our surface integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}⟨{cos}^{2}⁡(xy),\\,{cos}^{2}⁡(xy),\\,1⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}(-P\\frac{∂g}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{∂y}+R)\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-({cos}^{2}⁡(xy))\\cdot (\\frac{y}{{cos}^{2}⁡(xy)})-({cos}^{2}⁡(xy))\\cdot (\\frac{x}{{cos}^{2}⁡(xy)})+1)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-y-x+1)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-x}^{0}(-y-x+1)\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-xy+y]}_{y=-x}^{y=0}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-{x}^{2}+x)\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+x)\\,dx \\\\  & ={[-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355862 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355863 13194139535575 true] [17592186355862 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355864 13194139535575 true] [17592186355862 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355865 13194139535575 true] [17592186355862 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355866 13194139535575 true] [17592186355862 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355867 13194139535575 true] [17592186355862 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535575 true] [17592186355862 1041 "selection" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355862 1104 #edb/ref 17592186355866 13194139535575 true] [17592186355862 1110 #uuid "0abd0d35-115c-5f41-b432-0c479a59b6e5" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355863 1034 "\\frac{5}{6}" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355863 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535575 true] [17592186355863 1111 #uuid "dd6a3bd1-8f7a-554e-ab87-c4b76cc69e44" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355864 1034 "\\pi -1" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355864 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535575 true] [17592186355864 1111 #uuid "ec5cf4ca-1ed0-56af-a739-2e16a03d83f3" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355865 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355865 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535575 true] [17592186355865 1111 #uuid "12fd981d-e3ee-5461-9b0b-b0aa84905509" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355866 1034 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355866 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535575 true] [17592186355866 1111 #uuid "2e66930b-da2a-561c-bbad-58ba4cb49ed2" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355867 1034 "0" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355867 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535575 true] [17592186355867 1111 #uuid "515ffcb7-e532-5100-8482-a11fe24009d6" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355868 1017 #edb/ref 17592186355869 13194139535575 true] [17592186355868 1089 "q-161542" 13194139535575 true] [17592186355868 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535575 true] [17592186355868 1100 "Calculate the flu